  "details": "Hi, a VR CHAT based movie streaming service partnered with a movie theatre company that has a digital rental service would be really cool. (2$ monthly world rental separate from VR Chat+ plus any movie rentals)\n\nTo make or enter the movie theatre instance, the players would pay a 2$ entry fee per month. Only the instance host/master would need to rent a movie for like 6 or 7$ each (paid through Steam or Meta store to VR Chat) and anyone who joins could enjoy the movie as if they're in a theatre or in a living room at a friends' place depending on the map. The instances in that world would automatically be locked to Friends (of the renter) or Invite only and the social status would automatically change to orange (ask me) when renting a movie.\n\nA movie service within VR Chat would help out the people who made the movie and generate a bit of extra income for VR Chat, Valve, (also meta if the service would be available on Quest) and the people who made the movies. Watching movies with friends in VR chat would be really fun.",
